  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "show-n",
      "program-n"
    ],
    "note": "For television and radio, **show** is the everyday word, especially in American English (*a TV show*, *a game show*). **Program** (British **programme**) is a little more formal and covers any broadcast, including the news. On a stage, a performance with singing or dancing is a **show**, not a **program**."
  },
